/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/3/005.md:7:> - 对象类：三角精灵体/triangle_sprite, 控制行/control_row, 控制列/control_column, 标记像素/marker_pixel, 边框段/border_segment, 矩形边界/rectangular_border, 边缘实心条/solid_edge_bar, 平行线段/parallel_segment, 分隔线/separator_line, 分区区域/partitioned_region, 孤立像素/isolated_pixel, 满行列条/full_span_bar, 分隔行/separator_row, 标记段/marker_run, 编码行/code_row, 同心正方形层/concentric_ring, 精灵体/sprite, 空心矩形/hollow_rectangle, 竖直线段/vertical_bar, 规则示例/rule_example, 模板图案/stencil_pattern, 边缘标记/edge_marker, 墙段/wall_segment, 面板序列/panel_sequence, 模板面板/template_panel, 周期瓦片/periodic_tile, 模板/template, 框架/frame, 前景对象/foreground_object, 对角线段/diagonal_bar, 前景像素/foreground_pixel, 多米诺骨牌/domino, 边墙/edge_wall, 控制像素/control_pixel, 整行整列射线/full_row_column_ray, 对角邻居/diagonal_neighbor, 分隔线网格/separator_grid, 掩码区域/mask_region, 单像素标记/singleton_marker
