/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/opus/3/007.md:8:> - 对象类：分隔线(divider_line/separator_line), 孤立像素(isolated_pixel), 画布边界(canvas_boundary), 标记像素(marker_pixel), 边缘线(edge_line), 标记块(marker_block), 提取区域(extracted_region), 十字图案(plus_pattern), 网格边缘(grid_edge), 条形段(bar_segment), 标记列(marker_column), 精灵体(sprite), 孔洞(hole), 矩形(rectangle), 障碍段(barrier_segment), 前景对象(foreground_object), 基本图元(primitive_shape), 图例面板(legend_panel), 编码块(encoded_block), 形状标记(shape_marker), 连通分量(connected_component), 对角线标记(diagonal_marker), 模板(template), 封闭孔洞(enclosed_hole), 单色对象(monochrome_object), 对称体(symmetric_object), 非对称体(asymmetric_object), 起点标记(start_marker), 终点标记(end_marker), 折线路径(folded_path), 二值掩码(binary_mask), 实心矩形(solid_rectangle), 间隙带(gap_strip), 前景掩码(foreground_mask), 线段(line_segment), 色段(color_run), 画布(canvas), 前景像素(foreground_pixel)
